---

Data source: gexdash.com public API (Schwab option-chain data). This toolkit
fetches from that API at runtime; the data itself is subject to gexdash's own
terms of use. Be a polite client: one request per expiry bucket per symbol,
back off on failure, and do not redistribute raw API payloads.
